# =============================================================================
# THE DEVELOPMENT TREE, WHICH IS NOT PUBLISHED
# =============================================================================
#
# What ships is src/, examples/, docs/, CMakeLists.txt and library.properties.
# The directories below are how the library is developed and proven, not what
# a user of it consumes, and they are not published.
#
# Everything that ships is built to work without them: CMakeLists.txt guards
# each optional subdirectory with EXISTS, so a clean clone configures and
# builds the library and the C++ examples, and installs under Arduino, with
# nothing else present.
internal/
scripts/
test/
tools/
hardware-test/
